-
-The model sees both general market context and explicit crossover state:
-
-- current EMA side;
-- exact cross direction;
-- hours since cross;
-- EMA spread and acceleration;
-- return since cross;
-- early post-cross sample weights.
-
-This design avoids training on only a handful of exact crossover bars while still making the post-cross reaction the dominant learning objective.
